# suite TDBSVC
ok 1 - SQLIO BEGN opens a transaction for the suite
ok 2 - fixture: core.Parameter row inserted
ok 3 - fixture: core.NumberSeries row inserted
ok 4 - PARMGET GETNUM reads the effective value
ok 5 - PARMGET GETNUM converts the value to a number
ok 6 - PARMGET returns the decision reference
ok 7 - PARMGET reports the effective date it used
ok 8 - PARMGET marks a numeric parameter as numeric
ok 9 - NUMGEN NEXT issues a number from the series
ok 10 - NUMGEN starts the fixture series at 1
ok 11 - NUMGEN formats prefix ZZ with 6 digits
ok 12 - NUMGEN replays the number for a repeated correlation
ok 13 - NUMGEN issues consecutive numbers without a gap
ok 14 - NUMGEN VOID records an abandoned number (D-15)
ok 15 - NUMGEN VOID marks the number as void
ok 16 - NUMGEN never reissues a voided number
ok 17 - PERIODCK allows posting into an OPEN period
ok 18 - PERIODCK reports 15 Oct 2026 as fiscal 2026 period 7
ok 19 - PERIODCK returns the period status
ok 20 - PERIODCK holds a SOFT closed period for authority
ok 21 - PERIODCK names the permission that would authorise it
ok 22 - PERIODCK lets the controller post a close adjustment
ok 23 - PERIODCK blocks posting into a HARD closed period
ok 24 - PERMCHK allows SYSADM to post a receipt
ok 25 - PERMCHK refuses the read-only auditor with 06
ok 26 - PERMCHK explains a refusal instead of staying silent
ok 27 - AUDITLOG WRITE records a sensitive amendment
ok 28 - AUDITLOG returns the identity of the row it wrote
ok 29 - AUDITLOG keeps the old and the new value
ok 30 - EXCPRAIS reports a HOLD as return code 06 (COM-017)
ok 31 - EXCPRAIS records the exception and returns its id
ok 32 - EXCPRAIS opens the exception for the work list
ok 33 - EXCPRAIS reports a WARNING as return code 04
ok 34 - IDEMPOT BEGIN lets new work proceed
ok 35 - IDEMPOT reports an attempt already in progress
ok 36 - IDEMPOT END closes the instruction as COMPLETED
ok 37 - IDEMPOT replays the first result, posting only once
ok 38 - IDEMPOT hands back the original result reference
ok 39 - IDEMPOT treats a new correlation id as new work
ok 40 - JOBLOG START registers a run and returns its id
ok 41 - JOBLOG START marks the run as RUNNING
ok 42 - JOBLOG END closes the run with its spool file
ok 43 - JOBLOG hands COMPLETE back in the caller's wording
ok 44 - JOBLOG stores the run as OK in core.JobRun
ok 45 - SQLIO ROLB leaves no trace of the fixtures
ok 46 - PARMGET rejects a blank parameter code
ok 47 - NUMGEN rejects a blank series code
ok 48 - PERIODCK rejects 30 February before touching SQL
ok 49 - PERMCHK rejects a blank permission code
ok 50 - AUDITLOG refuses a write with no entity type
ok 51 - AUDITLOG refuses an entry with no user
ok 52 - EXCPRAIS rejects a severity outside HOLD/WARNING/ERROR
ok 53 - EXCPRAIS refuses an exception with no message
ok 54 - EXCPRAIS refuses an exception with no owner (COM-022)
ok 55 - IDEMPOT rejects a blank correlation id
ok 56 - JOBLOG rejects a run with no job name
ok 57 - JOBLOG END rejects a run id that was never started
ok 58 - JOBLOG rejects an end status it does not know
ok 59 - PARMGET falls back to the caller default with 04
ok 60 - PARMGET reports 16 when nothing is held
ok 61 - NUMGEN reports an unknown series rather than guessing
ok 62 - PERIODCK refuses a date with no accounting period
1..62
# TDBSVC passed 00062 failed 00000
# exit 0
